-- The words the instruction looks for are in the text on a given day. The consolidation (Wikisource revision 2966245, 4 December 2025) already prints the replaced words, so from that day the answer is no (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY);
-- before it the sources do not say when section 73 of the Economic Plan Law began to apply, so the answer is NOTHING. No day is answered YES.
GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
