        `the citing words are in` IS "section 1, definition of a provident fund"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the definition of a provident fund in section 47 of the Income Tax Ordinance`
        `the target is` IS `a paragraph of the Income Tax Ordinance deleted in 2005, the definition now being in section 1 of the Provident Funds Law`
        `limb (a) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (a) was read` IS `read from an official instrument`
        `limb (b) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (b) was read` IS `CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
